==Trivia==
*Raclesa was first made obtainable in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] on December 12th, 2025.
**In [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]], she was first made obtainable on March 27th, 2026.
*Even though Raclesa was added to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] in [[Version 15.0 Update|15.0]], she was removed from the [[Cat Guide]] in [[Version 15.1 Update|15.1]] and then later readded in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].
*When first added to BCEN's files, Raclesa was named "Raclesa the Lioness", but then was later renamed to just "Raclesa" in Version 15.2.
**The event info for and text beneath the [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Galaxy Gals]] banner both refer to her with her old title.
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], Her, [[Pegasa (Uber Rare Cat)|Pegasa]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]], [[Lilin (Uber Rare Cat)|Lilin]] and [[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Jeanne]]'s Evolved Forms were missing the ", type" part of their names that other Galaxy Gals had.
*The Σ in her Evolved Form's name is the Greek letter "sigma".
**Σ was originally assigned to [[Wise Empress Nobel (PC Uber Rare Cat)|Wise Empress Nobel]], a unit that was exclusive to the now-discontinued [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC Version]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]].
*Raclesa appears to be based on [[wikipedia:Heracles|Heracles]], a hero from Greek mythology who is known for his strength. The name ラクレス ''Rakuresu'' (Racles) is one syllable away from ヘラクレス ''Herakuresu'' (Heracles), and the "Lioness" title that she originally had could be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Nemean Lion|Nemean Lion]], whose pelt was worn by Heracles after he defeated it.
*Although it literally translates to "silence even a crying child", the phrase 泣く子も黙る ''nakukomodamaru'' in Raclesa, type Σ's Japanese description is an idiom simply referring to how intimidating her presence is, not that she is literally good at making kids quiet down.
*Raclesa's design may be a reference to [https://ultrakill.wiki.gg/wiki/V1 V1], the player character from the FPS game ''Ultrakill''. This is most evident during her attack animation, when the drones clustered around her shoulders become active.
*Raclesa and [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Kai]] are the only Galaxy Gals to not appear floating.
*[[Jeanne (Legend Rare Cat)|Headmistress Jeanne]], [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Huntress Terun]] and Raclesa the Lioness were the only Galaxy Gals to have titles in their English names, prior to Jeanne's and Raclesa's being removed in BCEN Version 15.2, and Terun's in Version 15.3.

